From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:28:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iommu: apple,dart: Add S5L8960X error reflector
 and configs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

iOS programs three more global registers of S5L8960X-style DARTs every
time it initializes one, from Apple device tree properties of the same
DART: the error reflector, the table fetch configuration and the
diagnostic configuration (AppleS5L8960XDART hardware init at
0xfffffff005fb5b58 in the iPad6,11 iOS 16.7.10 kernelcache).

Describe them as optional properties. They are per-DART hardware
configuration that the boot loader's device tree carries; the iPad 5
(A9) and iPad 6 (A10) PCIe DARTs use the same values.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 50e9494d (J71t ledger 1.6); the
 apple,dma-range property is left out (superseded by the five-cell
 DMA window specifier, ledger 1.5); the properties are restricted to
 S5L8960X DARTs and an example is added]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml | 43 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
index de2ce3dd4..95f4843cc 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
@@ -61,12 +61,44 @@ properties:
   power-domains:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  apple,error-reflector:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint64
+    description:
+      Physical address of the page that faulting transactions are redirected
+      to, so that they complete instead of stalling the master. From the
+      Apple device tree property "error-reflector" of the same DART.
+
+  apple,fetch-config:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    description:
+      Value of the table fetch configuration register, from the Apple device
+      tree property "fetch-config" of the same DART.
+
+  apple,diag-config:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    description:
+      Value of the diagnostic configuration register, from the Apple device
+      tree property "diag-config" of the same DART.
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
   - '#iommu-cells'
   - interrupts
 
+allOf:
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          not:
+            contains:
+              const: apple,s5l8960x-dart
+    then:
+      properties:
+        apple,error-reflector: false
+        apple,fetch-config: false
+        apple,diag-config: false
+
 additionalProperties: false
 
 examples:
@@ -99,3 +131,14 @@ examples:
     master2 {
       iommus = <&dart2a 0>, <&dart2b 1>;
     };
+
+  - |+
+    dart3: iommu@1008000 {
+      compatible = "apple,s8000-dart", "apple,s5l8960x-dart";
+      reg = <0x1008000 0x4000>;
+      interrupts = <1 245 4>;
+      #iommu-cells = <5>;
+      apple,error-reflector = /bits/ 64 <0x20fffc000>;
+      apple,fetch-config = <0x000e0303>;
+      apple,diag-config = <0x00000100>;
+    };
